

Talent Protocol is a Web3 platform designed to build verifiable professional reputations on-chain, using a “Talent Passport,” public contributions, on-chain data, and identity signals.

The platform has run several reward programs across different ecosystems.

With the new Stacks Builder Challenges, Talent Protocol expands into the Stacks / Bitcoin L2 ecosystem, enabling developers to earn STX rewards while contributing to a growing network focused on smart contracts anchored to Bitcoin.
